Morning Everybody,<P>** DISCLAIMER:  This is a LONG post, so get a fresh cup of coffee, and Rich or Ned, feel free to give me a call if you feel like talking about this post.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>Has everyone seen the new option to move chars between servers that VI is offering?  If not, go check it out at the EQ site (I don't have the link handy).  Basically you can move from one server to another, move a char from one account to another etc etc.  The problem is, if you move between servers you move COMPLETELY naked.  No items, No cash, nothing.  So, even though it would be a completely naked move, I'm considering moving Lonar to Bertox.  <P>Why move my alt (Lonar) and not my main (Sendil)?  Well, as Rich so eloquently puts it, i'm a farmer with Lonar.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  Him moving naked is far more palatable to me than moving Sendil naked.  The items that would be nearly irreplaceable for Sendil are far greater than for Lonar.  Lonar would end up losing the following items that can't be easily replaced:<P>Blighted Gloves<BR>Blighted Legs<BR>PoGrowth Arms<BR>Pre-Nerf Circlet of Shadow<BR>Encyclopedia Necrotheurgia (Necro Pet Focus Item)<BR>Froglock Bonecaster Robe<BR>J-Boots<P>Of those items I'm really only bummed about losing 3 of them,  the encyclopedia, the j-boots, and the Circlet.  The rest of my gear can be pretty easily replaced with a little time and effort.  Once Lonar is fully re-equipped, I can easily farm for more gear for Kalaan, getting him to a respectable level of Full-Twinkage. :P  <P>Add in the fact that with Lonar I can immediately jump into doing things/raids with Ghall/Sleethr/Shato/Heelir/Nef/et al.  I'm going to list out Lonars full equipment, and what I'm hoping to get him on Bertox, if you all think you can fairly easily help me acquire a portion of these items, I'll submit Lonar to be moved this afternoon.  Let me know.  <P>Current Equipment:<BR>Ear 1	Batskull Earring	<BR>Ear 2	Batskull Earring	<BR>Face	Sheer Bone Mask	<BR>Head	Froglok Crown	<BR>Neck	7STR/7INT Necklace	<BR>Ring 1	Ring of the Goblin Lord	<BR>Ring 2	+4INT Ring<BR>Wrist 1	Woven Grass Bracelet	<BR>Wrist 2	Woven Grass Bracelet	<BR>Arms	Bonecaster Sleeves	<BR>Chest	Froglock Bonecasters Robe	<BR>Hands	Blighted Gloves	<BR>Waist	Braided Cinch Cord	<BR>Legs	Blighted Trousers	<BR>Feet	Shadowbound Boots	<BR>Melee 1	Encyclo. Necro.	<BR>Melee 2	Stein of Moggok	<BR>Range	Shardwurm Eye	<BR>Ammo	 	<BR>Back	Polar Bear Cloak	<BR>Shoulder	Mantle of Mirth<P>Misc. Items:<BR>Jboots<BR>Evil Eye Bag<BR>Full Set of Diamond Resist Gear (2 earrings, mask, 2 bracers, 2 rings, +9vs magic Necklace)<BR>Sentry Robe<BR>*****<BR>Future Equipment:<BR>Ear 1	Batskull Earring	<BR>Ear 2	Batskull Earring	<BR>Face	Sheer Bone Mask	<BR>Head	Froglok Crown	<BR>Neck	7STR/7INT	<BR>Ring 1	Ring/Goblin Lord	<BR>Ring 2	4INT	<BR>Wrist 1	Woven Grass Bracelet	<BR>Wrist 2	Woven Grass Bracelet	<BR>Arms	**Gatorscale Sleeves**	<BR>Chest	**Sentry Robe/SMR**	<BR>Hands	**Shadowbound Gloves**	<BR>Waist	Braided Cinch Cord	<BR>Legs	**Silversilk Leggings**	<BR>Feet	Shadowbound Boots	<BR>Melee 1	**Harvester**	<BR>Melee 2	Stein of Moggok	<BR>Range	Shardwurm Eye	<BR>Ammo	 	<BR>Back	Polar Bear Cloak	<BR>Shoulder	Mantle of Mirth<P>Misc. Items:<BR>Evil Eye Bag<BR>J-Boots<P>Most of the items that I'm hoping to re-equip Lonar with, I can get on my own, it will just take an ass-load of camping, either for the cash to buy them, or for the items themselves.  The only items that I will really need help with are the Stein of Moggok, the Froglok Crown, and the jewelcrafted items (Necklace and Ring).  With that said, if anyone has any of the other items laying around, and they don't mind parting with them, I might be asking for them sometime in the near future.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  I'll find a way to compensate you for them I promise.<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 55th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Rakasak Smakatak - 21st Level Monk<BR>Bertox. Server
