Has anybody received confirmation that their chars have been moved?  I know its only been 3 days since I submitted my move but sheesh, not much a person can do while completely naked, I'm ready to get moved!  <P>Just out of curiosity, I took Lonar to SolA for 1 hour, to see how much plat I could raise as a naked necro.  I ran out to Nektolus forest, killed skeletons till I had a few bone chips, then ran up to sola, summoned a pet, and ran through the zone killing everything I came across.  1 hour later i was barely able to move I had so much crap on me.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  I gated back to neriak, and sold all the Fine steel and HQ ore I had picked up.  Final Tally?  175pp in 1 hour.  My Conclusion?  If SolA is as deserted on Bertox as it is on SolRo (Approx 4-6 people in zone), than I might just take a couple nights of gaming and make some plat.  I figure if I take the 6 hours i play on wednesday and the 6 on thursday I can bank approx 2100pp.  Not an earth-shattering amount, but it should hopefully be enough to get me partially back on my feet on Bertox.<P>Anyone know the going rate on the following items on Bertox?<BR>Yak<BR>Slime Coated Harpoon<BR>Mrylokar Arms/Boots/Helm/Bracers/Guantlets<BR>6ac/65HP or 5ac/55HP jewelcrafted rings<BR>Crown of the Froglock King<BR>FBSS<BR>Hooded Black Cloak<BR>Idol of the Thorned<BR>Locustlure<BR>Serpents Tooth<BR>Blood Point<BR>Shining Metallic Robes<BR>Crystalline Robes<P>I know its a lot of items  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  I have no real way to find the prices on those items here at the office, and I'm trying to think of how best to go about farming up some cash to buy some stuff.  I got a couple more questions about camps and zones, so here goes.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>How camped are these areas:<BR>Anyone know how camped LGuk is?  Magi/Lord/Frenzy pretty well camped solid?<BR>Cyndreela at the Fear Gate in Feerot?<BR>Chief area in Droga?<BR>Seafuries/Gornit in OOT?<BR>AC in OOT?<BR>Queen area in Crystal Caverns?<BR>Ry'Gorr Ocr Fort in East Wastes?<BR>Pool Room/Ziglark Whisperwing area in Skyshrine?<P>Guess thats about it for now.<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 55th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Rakasak Smakatak - 21st Level Monk<BR>Bertox. Server
