Frog Crown: 900-1100pp (seen one as low as 800)<BR>FBSS: 8-10k<BR>SMR: 2.5k<P>L Guk, moderately camped (compared to the good old days)  If I got done with work at 4 p.m. I could get to Guk and probably at least one of the big camp areas would actually be open (Ass/Sup, Lord, Magi)  Last week we started in Guk at 6 p.m. and Magi was open (and Ass/Sup was unoccupied for a while too)  King is often open.<P>Cyndreela, often open, but many times there is a guild just moving into Fear or doing CR which really screws up the camp.  Though if they're cool and let you have Cyndreela, its nice because they also end up absorbing the annoying ice bones too.<P>There have almost always been Seafuries available, Gornit is often camped.<P>I haven't been to AC since January, often a waiting list, but if you hang out at Seafuries just get on the list for AC each day and you'll probably get your chance before the week is out and a respectable amount of gems/plat from Seafuries, and some easy exp (not neccesarily fast, since they'll mostly be green)  Sunday and Monday night seem to be great times to get AC camp.  Just be prepared to call in sick for the following day   <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">
